# Dataset
laptop specifications and price prediction dataset is used to create this project

## source:
- kaggle: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/muhammadmusharraf444/laptop-specifications-and-price-prediction-dataset

This dataset contains detailed information about 1,302 laptops from various manufacturers and is designed for machine learning, data analysis, and price prediction tasks. 
It includes laptop specifications such as hardware configuration, display features, storage options, operating systems, and market prices.
The dataset can be used to explore the factors that influence laptop pricing, perform exploratory data analysis (EDA), build regression models, and develop recommendation systems.
